/**
 * @mainpage MeshCore C Library
 *
 * Platform-neutral C protocol/runtime library for a host-owned event pump.
 *
 * - @ref meshcore_runtime "Runtime API": lifecycle, requests and radio/timer ingress.
 * - @ref meshcore_platform "Platform hooks": link-time hooks implemented by the host.
 * - @ref meshcore_types "Shared types": public limits, types and borrowed views.
 *
 * The runtime is singleton, single-threaded and non-reentrant. Platform
 * callbacks run synchronously; enqueue follow-up work rather than reentering.
 * See the repository's README and docs/porting.md for complete integration
 * instructions and host security responsibilities.
 */
